1
00:00:00,258 --> 00:00:02,218
Pa... kumain ka na?

2
00:00:02,758 --> 00:00:04,958
Anak, nandito ka na.

3
00:00:14,883 --> 00:00:17,483
Ate, sa iyo ang hugasin.

4
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:20,170
Basta ikaw ang magluluto.

5
00:00:20,717 --> 00:00:23,237
Teka. Apat pa rin?

6
00:00:23,792 --> 00:00:25,512
Pa, iwan mo lang.

7
00:00:26,792 --> 00:00:29,272
Ma... nakauwi na ako.

8
00:00:30,095 --> 00:00:34,085
Kulang pa rin. Pero magkakasama tayo.

9
00:00:34,842 --> 00:00:36,522
Kain na tayo, Pa.
